{
"id": "5a0b0fc8fd1e48468fe289997085b0bb",
"title": "Jungle Solitaire",
"iframe": "https://html5.gamedistribution.com/5a0b0fc8fd1e48468fe289997085b0bb/",
"description": "Match cards by suit and sequence to clear the jungle-themed solitaire layout featuring animal motifs. Players navigate stacked card columns using classic solitaire rules enhanced with animal tokens that unlock bonus moves. The main goal is to empty the tableau through strategic card matching while managing limited deck cycles.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Suit and rank matching mechanic  \n• Drag-and-drop card controls  \n• Progressive unlock of animal bonuses  \n• Limited deck reshuffle cycles  \n• Jungle animal motif visuals"
